This directory contains tests adapted from PGlite (electric-sql/pglite),
commit faa505ad2ea0d14dfb1c99ab9614361c39d2c7e2, under the Apache License 2.0.
Original work: PGlite contributors. A copy of the license is in LICENSE.
Source file hashes, original test names and migration decisions are recorded
in upstream.json and cases.json.

Modifications by PostGamma contributors: use the PostGamma browser API,
explicit parameter OIDs and wire values, deterministic SQL ordering, bounded
result/stream checks, SQL audit rows for triggers, and a browser matrix runner.
These adaptations do not claim compatibility with PGlite's JavaScript API.
